Define struct Odd1 with a as u8 and b as i64 and c as u8.
Define global arr as array<Odd1, 16>.
i is 0.
total is 0.
Loop:
    If i is at least 16, Break.
    Set arr[i].a to i as u8.
    Set arr[i].b to i * 3.
    Set arr[i].c to (i + 1) as u8.
    total += arr[i].b.
    i += 1.
Return total bitand 255.
